# Bindings.xml is intentionally not listed here: the client auto-loads any
# Bindings.xml sitting in the addon's root. Listing it explicitly makes it
# get parsed a second time through the generic UI-file XML parser, which
# does not recognize <Binding> and throws "Unrecognized XML: Binding".
